{"_id":"0Phm33401duLGaJ0","name":"⏩Ironclad Defense III: Armored Core","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 5 Tactician Required","cost":"None","metadata":"Rank: Rank 3\nType: Defense\nEdge Cost: None\nEdge Accumulation: +1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":1,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:ironclad-defense-iii-armored-core","description":"Issues commands to anticipate any damage and directs a safer and more reliable defense.\n\nWhen physical or magical damage is applied to the targets within 10 seconds (1 round), the damage is reduced by -1 point. Note that Poison-, Disease-, or Curse-type damage cannot be reduced.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"0bnsMgoJ6sJOp43u","name":"◯Strong Throws","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"-","metadata":"Cost: -\nPrerequisite: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:strong-throws","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Thrown Attack physical damage +1 to +3 (Daemons or Undead +2 to +4)\n\nThe physical damage caused by Dark Hunter's thrown attack is increased by +1. If the attack target is a character classified as \"Daemon\" or \"Undead,\" it is further increased by +1 point (total +2 points).\n\nWhen the user's Dark Hunter class level reaches 5, the damage increase becomes +2 (+3 for Daemon and Undead).\n\nWhen the user's Dark Hunter class level reaches 10, the damage increase becomes +3 (+4 for Daemon and Undead).","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"0jwkGvIa6sLgTsO4","name":"⏩△Spectral Protective Circle","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"1dHP","metadata":"Cost: 1dHP\nPrerequisite: None\nTarget: 1 Character\nRange/Area: 1 (10m) / Target\nDuration: 30 seconds (3 rounds)\nResistance: Optional","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"1d","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:spectral-protective-circle","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Damage reduction -2 (Daemons or Undead -3)\n\nFor the duration of the effect, all physical and magical damage received by the target is reduced by 2 points. If the damage source is classified as \"Daemon\" or \"Undead,\" the reduction is 3 points.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"1FlzJZspcjaXgw8b","name":"Dance of the Fire Dragon","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Bard","featureType":"finale","requirement":"Finale, Level 10 Bard Required","cost":"⮭6","metadata":"Rhythm Cost: ⮭6\nResistance: Half\nType: Fire and Wind","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":6,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/finale:dance-of-the-fire-dragon","description":"Up to 5 target characters are dealt Power 30 + Bardic Power magic damage.\n\n30 2 4 4 6 7 8 9 10 10 10 ⑩\n\nPower Table (Power 30, Critical 10)\n3: 2  |  4: 4  |  5: 4  |  6: 6  |  7: 7  |  8: 8  |  9: 9  |  10: 10  |  11: 10  |  12: 10","mpCost":0,"power":30,"powerTable":{"3":2,"4":4,"5":4,"6":6,"7":7,"8":8,"9":9,"10":10,"11":10,"12":10},"critical":10,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":true,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Bard","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
