{"_id":"J305TQtKijeaTyaF","name":"⏩△Mirage Daze","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Alchemist","featureType":"evocation","requirement":"Evocation, 1st Level Alchemist Required","cost":"White","metadata":"Cards: White\nTarget: 1 character\nRange/Area: 2 (30m) / Target\nDuration: 1 minute (6 rounds)\nResistance: Temporary","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"white","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/evocation:mirage-daze","description":"The target is disoriented and confused. The target receives a penalty to its Accuracy check for the duration of the effect.\n\nB: None\n\nA: -1 Accuracy\n\nS: -2 Accuracy\n\nSS: -4 Accuracy","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Alchemist","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"J6JFKc4ALGtx67eh","name":"Earthly Domain: Liquidation","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Geomancer","featureType":"aspect","requirement":"Aspect, 1st Level Geomancer Required","cost":"Earthly Qi 1 - 2","metadata":"Cost: Earthly Qi 1 - 2\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"earthly","qiMin":1,"qiMax":2,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/aspect:earthly-domain-liquidation","description":"This technique causes water to roll up around the target, allowing it to use its ability to swim.\n\nBy using 1 point of Earthly Qi, the target can be treated as if it were in the water for the duration of the effect, but this movement is limited to within the Geomancer's Domain Range. The target does not incur any penalties, such as being unable to breathe or speak or limitations on movement or actions.\n\nIf used with 2 points of Earthly Qi, the target gains a +1 bonus to action checks if it has [ Sword's Grace/Gentle Water ], [Underwater Aptitude], or any other ability that removes penalties for being underwater.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Geomancer","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"JF0EjIdsWpiavjjS","name":"Earthly Domain: Healing Earth","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Geomancer","featureType":"aspect","requirement":"Aspect, 1st Level Geomancer Required","cost":"Earthly Qi 1 - 4","metadata":"Cost: Earthly Qi 1 - 4\nDuration: Instant","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"earthly","qiMin":1,"qiMax":4,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/aspect:earthly-domain-healing-earth","description":"This ability absorbs the vitality of the earth and heals wounds. The target regains double the amount of Earthly Qi consumed in HP.\n\nThis Aspect can only be used once per day.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Geomancer","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"JIG7dZKhTAXnacVT","name":"◯Dark Life","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 5 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"-","metadata":"Cost: -\nPrerequisite: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:dark-life","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 5 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Consume 1d HP to gain +1 to Evasion and Resistance Checks; automatic in a Shallow Abyss\n\nWhen a Dark Hunter performs an Evasion check, or a Fortitude and Willpower check, they can consume 1d HP after seeing the roll result to increase their Success Value by +1. Using this effect is optional, but once the HP consumption is decided, it cannot be canceled.\n\nInside a Shallow Abyss, this +1 bonus to Success Value is applied automatically without HP consumption, and it also applies to Death Checks.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"Jglw3q84R9788qkr","name":"⏩Essence Focus","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"1dHP","metadata":"Cost: 1dHP\nPrerequisite: None\nTarget: Caster\nRange/Area: Caster\nDuration: 30 seconds (3 rounds)\nResistance: Optional","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"1d","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:essence-focus","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Thrown weapon Accuracy +1 (Daemons, Undead +2)\n\nFor the duration of the effect, the Dark Hunter gains a +1 bonus to Accuracy checks for all thrown attacks they perform. If the attack target is a character classified as \"Daemon\" or \"Undead,\" the bonus is increased by an additional +1 (total +2).","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"JsGT4pGUAtrfOb6Z","name":"Fall","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Bard","featureType":"spellsong","requirement":"Spellsong, Level 10 Bard Required","cost":"","metadata":"Singing: Not Required\nPet: Insect\nEffect Condition: ⮯6\nResistance: Negates\nType: Psychic\nBase Rhythm: ⮯2\nFlourish Value: 24\nExtra Rhythm: ⮯2","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":2,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":2,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/spellsong:fall","description":"If a flying target is in the air at the time of the effect, the target will be forced to fall to the ground. See \"Forced Fall Effect\" (CR II, p. 79) for falling rules. While under the Spellsong's effect, the target cannot fly again. [ Sword's Grace/Wings Of The Wind ] cannot be used, and any [Flying] unique skill is lost. A character whose movement method is only airborne, such as \"Flying\" or \"Floating,\" cannot move.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Bard","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"KbV7vVSsfWYuuYXi","name":"△Strategic Ingenuity","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"maneuver","requirement":"Maneuver, Level 1 Tactician Required","cost":"None","metadata":"Conditions: -\nPrerequisite: When making an Initiative check\nEdge Cost: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/maneuver:strategic-ingenuity","description":"Tactician can use their intelligence to gain the upper hand over the enemy.\n\nDuring the Initiative check, Tactician can optionally use as the standard value Tactician class +Intelligence modifier + 1.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"KhwOfrEUlxFVRGrH","name":"△Solid Line","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"maneuver","requirement":"Maneuver, Level 5 Tactician Required","cost":"None","metadata":"Conditions: -\nPrerequisite: When a Tactician restores 30 or more points of HP to an ally\nEdge Cost: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/maneuver:solid-line","description":"A Tactician can heal their allies, speeding up their next move.\n\nThe Tactician can declare the use of this Maneuver once they have restored the current HP value of a Stratagem-applicable ally by 30 points or more, whether through casting a spell or a Combat Feat (if the damage is less than 30 HP because it went over the maximum, it doesn't count). Tactician accumulates Edge 1 point.\n\nThis Maneuver can be used exceptionally, once per fulfillment of the conditions, ignoring the limit on the number of times it can be used.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"Ki45ojwxDKmHitNT","name":"Ambience","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Bard","featureType":"spellsong","requirement":"Spellsong, Level 1 Bard Required","cost":"","metadata":"Singing: Not Required\nPet: Frog, Insect\nEffect Condition: None\nResistance: Negates\nType: Psychic\nBase Rhythm: ⮯1\nFlourish Value: 13\nExtra Rhythm: ⮯1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":1,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":1,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/spellsong:ambience","description":"This slow, droning melody calms the nerves and makes one unwilling to fight. The target takes a -1 penalty on Accuracy checks.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Bard","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"Kvbw7vy6xi7ZwjvD","name":"⏩△Combine Materials","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Alchemist","featureType":"evocation","requirement":"Evocation, 10th Level Alchemist Required","cost":"White x 1 &amp; Black x 1","metadata":"Cards: White x 1 &amp; Black x 1\nTarget: Caster\nRange/Area: Caster\nDuration: 3 minutes (18 rounds)\nResistance: Optional","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"white","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/evocation:combine-materials","description":"For the duration, the caster can combine their material cards and use them as a card of higher rank. Multiple cards of any rank can be used as a card of one rank higher (e.g., multiple cards of rank B can be combined into a card of A rank). The number of cards to be combined is determined by the rank of the card of the next Evocation. The color and rank of the cards to be combined must be the same.\n\nSS-rank material cards can only be combined into SS cards. This effect is effective even if this Evocation consumes multiple cards simultaneously.\n\nB: 10 cards can be combined and used as an A rank card.\n\nA: 8 cards can be combined and used as an S rank card.\n\nS: 6 cards can be combined and used as a SS rank card.\n\nSS: 4 cards can be combined and used as a SS rank card.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Alchemist","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"L894NMR1fMc8IRX8","name":"⏩Injury Assessment","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 10 Tactician Required","cost":"1 Edge","metadata":"Rank: Rank 2\nType: Inspirational\nEdge Cost: 1 Edge\nEdge Accumulation: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":1},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:injury-assessment","description":"Accurately assesses injuries to allies and provides accurate treatment instructions.\n\nIf the targets recover at least 1 point of HP for the next 10 seconds (1 round), they recover an additional 5 points of HP.\n\nThe Tactician using this Stratagem may choose to use a Rank 3 Stratagem of any type in the next round.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"LNPP0SGMNFaxdh4R","name":"⏩Defiant Stand V: Aetheric Spring","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 10 Tactician Required","cost":"5 Edge","metadata":"Rank: Rank 5\nType: Resistance\nEdge Cost: 5 Edge\nEdge Accumulation: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":5},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:defiant-stand-v-aetheric-spring","description":"This ability calms the mind with a beautiful singing voice, allowing the targets to achieve the desired effect with less mana.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), whenever the targets consume MP through spellcasting, skill use, or item use, their MP consumption is reduced by 5 points. This effect cannot reduce MP consumption to 0; at least 1 point must be consumed.\n\nThis effect can stack with other effects that reduce MP consumption, but it is applied first, reducing MP consumption by 5 points before other effects come into effect.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"LfWnU9o7alhm1gnD","name":"⏩Surging Offense IV: Radiant Strikes","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 5 Tactician Required","cost":"None","metadata":"Rank: Rank 4\nType: Attack\nEdge Cost: None\nEdge Accumulation: +2","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":2,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:surging-offense-iv-radiant-strikes","description":"Commands a direct attack with the Tactician's next move in mind.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), the targets gain a +1 bonus to Accuracy checks and +1 point to physical damage when making melee or ranged attacks.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"Lsy6SoCyYQayPSiH","name":"►Spectral Throw","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"2d(6)HP","metadata":"Cost: 2d(6)HP\nPrerequisite: None\nTarget: 1 Character\nRange/Area: Special / Shot\nDuration: Instant\nResistance: Negates","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:spectral-throw","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Perform thrown attack using Mental Power\n\nPerform a thrown attack using the Dark Hunter class and Spirit. The effects of Combat Feats [ Dual Wielding ] and [ Throwing ] cannot be applied to it.\n\nWeapons are limited to those in the category thrown weapon with \"Stance: 1H\". In this case, Spirit is used instead of Strength to consider the weapon's minimum strength requirement. When using a higher-rank weapon as a thrown weapon, the necessary rank of [ Weapon Proficiency/Thrown Weapons ] is required, and the Extra Damage increase from that Combat Feat is effective.\n\nBoth Accuracy checks and Extra Damage calculations are performed using Mental Power.\n\nThere is no need to perform the physical throwing motion. Dark Hunters can manipulate and throw weapons such as throwing knives tucked in their belts or throwing spears on their backs using Spirit. They don't need to have the weapon equipped, and it doesn't matter if their hands are tied or in an unfavorable position; they won't receive any penalties.\n\nHowever, they can only throw weapons that the Dark Hunter is physically touching or carrying as part of their belongings. For example, they cannot throw something hanging on a wall without touching it. Additionally, they cannot throw weapons that are tied down, stored deep in a backpack, or equipped or held by other characters.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"Lycedr24dKE6qPBd","name":"◯Unique Skill Perfect Release","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Rider","featureType":"stunt","requirement":"Stunt, Level 10 Rider Required","cost":"","metadata":"Prerequisite: [ Unique Skill Release ]","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stunt:unique-skill-perfect-release","description":"Compatible: Animals, Mythical Beasts, Magitech\n\nArea: All\n\nThe jockey awakens the mount's latent potential and takes full control of it. With this Stunt, a mount's unique skills with \" Prerequisite: Unique Skill Perfect Release\" can now be used. Additionally, unique skills with \" Enhance: Unique Skill Perfect Release\" can be used to their full extent.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Rider","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"M2rxHmXgj6HYej4H","name":"Earthly Domain: Sand Shield","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Geomancer","featureType":"aspect","requirement":"Aspect, 5th Level Geomancer Required","cost":"Earthly Qi 1 - 4","metadata":"Cost: Earthly Qi 1 - 4\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"earthly","qiMin":1,"qiMax":4,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/aspect:earthly-domain-sand-shield","description":"Dust rises around the target, providing temporary armor.\n\nFor the duration of the effect, the target's Defense is increased by (Earthly Qi consumed x 2) points.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Geomancer","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
