{"_id":"Mbfwewa6UgovERpI","name":"⏩△Strong Blood","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Enhancer","featureType":"technique","requirement":"Technique, Level 1 Enhancer Required","cost":"","metadata":"Duration: 30 seconds (3 rounds)","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/technique:strong-blood","description":"By keeping a consistent body temperature, the user can stay cool in hot environments and vice versa.\n\nWhen taking any Fire-type or Water/Ice-type damage, reduce the total damage taken by 5 points.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Enhancer","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"Mhv6lDFQ0e9Jion0","name":"Autumn Harvest","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Bard","featureType":"finale","requirement":"Finale, Level 1 Bard Required","cost":"⮯1♡1","metadata":"Rhythm Cost: ⮯1♡1\nResistance: Optional\nType: -","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":1,"enchanting":1},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/finale:autumn-harvest","description":"Restores one target character's MP by Power 0 + Bardic Power points.\n\nThe effect of [Finale: Autumn Harvest] can only be received once per target character per day. Undead, Magitech, and Constructs cannot be affected by this Finale.\n\n0 0 0 0 1 2 2 3 3 4 4 None\n\nPower Table (Power 0, Critical —)\n3: 0  |  4: 0  |  5: 0  |  6: 1  |  7: 2  |  8: 2  |  9: 3  |  10: 3  |  11: 4  |  12: 4","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{"3":0,"4":0,"5":0,"6":1,"7":2,"8":2,"9":3,"10":3,"11":4,"12":4},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":true,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Bard","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"NE2uJZPP1oMtJprk","name":"Lullaby","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Bard","featureType":"spellsong","requirement":"Spellsong, Level 5 Bard Required","cost":"","metadata":"Singing: Required\nPet: -\nEffect Condition: ⮯4♡4\nResistance: Negates\nType: Psychic (Weak)\nBase Rhythm: ⮯2\nFlourish Value: 18\nExtra Rhythm: ♡1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":2,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":1},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/spellsong:lullaby","description":"An inviting melody that gently lulls listeners into a state of drowsiness. The subjects are dizzy and unable to move or take any active action. If forced to make an Action Check (see CR I, p. 114), the target takes a -4 penalty.\n\nThe duration of this Spellsong is 10 seconds (1 round), as usual. After that time, the drowsiness automatically disappears.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Bard","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"NGAwd3T6nKUBlysU","name":"Spirit Domain: Refresh","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Geomancer","featureType":"aspect","requirement":"Aspect, 1st Level Geomancer Required","cost":"Spirit Qi 1 - 4","metadata":"Cost: Spirit Qi 1 - 4\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"spirit","qiMin":1,"qiMax":4,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/aspect:spirit-domain-refresh","description":"This Aspect restores inner balance within the target, allowing them to recover MP equal to the amount of Spirit Qi consumed. This effect will not restore more MP than half of the target's maximum MP value.\n\nThis Aspect can only be used once per day.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Geomancer","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"NN4VbM3cm7lOuUMk","name":"⏩Ironclad Defense V: Steel Citadel","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 10 Tactician Required","cost":"5 Edge","metadata":"Rank: Rank 5\nType: Defense\nEdge Cost: 5 Edge\nEdge Accumulation: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":5},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:ironclad-defense-v-steel-citadel","description":"Commands a strategy to effectively repel the enemy's attack to the maximum extent possible.\n\nThe target's Defense is increased by +7 for 10 seconds (1 round).","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"NOefTzz6gnTmHiYW","name":"⏩Rabbit Ears","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Enhancer","featureType":"technique","requirement":"Technique, Level 1 Enhancer Required","cost":"","metadata":"Duration: 3 minutes (18 rounds)","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/technique:rabbit-ears","description":"The user can more accurately detect incoming danger by making their ears bigger and more flexible.\n\nThe user gains a +2 bonus to Listen and Danger Sense checks.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Enhancer","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"NZExhdymUXJzqy3Z","name":"⏩△Mana Sprout","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Alchemist","featureType":"evocation","requirement":"Evocation, 5th Level Alchemist Required","cost":"Gold","metadata":"Cards: Gold\nTarget: 1 character\nRange/Area: 1 (10m) / Shot\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)\nResistance: Can't","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"gold","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/evocation:mana-sprout","description":"Mana is generated and given to the target. The target temporarily gains MP and can spend it freely (it is separate from the character's MP). After the duration has expired, this MP will disappear even if it is not used.\n\nB: 1 MP\n\nA: 3 MP\n\nS: 10 MP\n\nSS: 20 MP","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Alchemist","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"Nuf8lOevVzo1wphG","name":"Charming","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Bard","featureType":"spellsong","requirement":"Spellsong, Level 5 Bard Required","cost":"","metadata":"Singing: Required\nPet: -\nEffect Condition: ♡4\nResistance: Negates\nType: Psychic (Weak)\nBase Rhythm: ♡2\nFlourish Value: 18\nExtra Rhythm: ♡1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":2},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":1},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/spellsong:charming","description":"The target is mesmerized by the Bard's singing and cannot bring themselves to harm the Bard.\n\nIn Contested Checks where the Bard is on the passive side, the Bard automatically gets a favorable result.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Bard","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"O6Vd7ci3NixLIpev","name":"⏩Owl Sight","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Enhancer","featureType":"technique","requirement":"Technique, Level 1 Enhancer Required","cost":"","metadata":"Duration: 3 minutes (18 rounds)","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/technique:owl-sight","description":"The user's eyes radiate gold, like that of an owl. This allows the user to see through darkness as though it were daylight. The user gains Darkvision.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Enhancer","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"OEZXyvhtFfaEOCOC","name":"⏩Flowing Fortunes V","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 10 Tactician Required","cost":"5 Edge","metadata":"Rank: Rank 5\nType: Evasion\nEdge Cost: 5 Edge\nEdge Accumulation: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":5},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:flowing-fortunes-v","description":"Reads enemy's lineup and directs the strategy to stop enemy advancement.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), the targets gain a +4 bonus to Evasion checks.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"OEirSZqq5JBpMLEh","name":"►Trample","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Rider","featureType":"stunt","requirement":"Stunt, Level 5 Rider Required","cost":"","metadata":"Prerequisite: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stunt:trample","description":"Compatible: Animals, Mythical Beasts, Magitech\n\nArea: All\n\nMount runs straight through the battlefield and attacks targets along its path.\n\nThis is considered a melee attack with \" Range/Area: 1 (mount's movement m)/ Breakthrough \". For each target, select a section (if a target is a mount, include its jockey) for a melee attack, and perform an Accuracy check and damage determination for each one separately.\n\nProcessing the Trample Stunt\n\nSelf-Exclusion\n\nWhen using the \"Area: Breakthrough\" effect, all sections of the Jockey and Mount are excluded from its effects.\n\nPosition (area, coordinate) Change at the Same Time\n\nWhen the \"Area: Breakthrough\" effect is used, all sections of a multi-section character, or a rider and mount, are moved to the endpoint of the Breakthrough.\n\nIf Effect Worked\n\nIn the case of multi-section characters and mounted riders/mounts, all of them are considered to have performed an action (Major Action or Minor Action, depending on the effect) when a Breakthrough effect is used. All such spells and abilities described in this book are used with Major Actions.\n\nIf each section, rider, or mount can still perform further Actions, and they wish to perform them individually, do the following:\n\n1. Perform Minor Actions sequentially for each section. Movement and Major Actions cannot be performed.\n\n2. Breakthrough effect\n\n3. Make the next actions of each section sequentially\n\nFalling Off a Mount During a Collision while Riding\n\nIf a mounted character encounters some factor that impedes their movement, such as a wall or a cliff, then the rider/mount will hit the wall, fall off the cliff, or whatever is appropriate.\n\nShould a mount crash into a wall, all sections of both rider and mount suffer damage and fall prone. This will also cause the rider to fall from the mount (see CR III, p. 89), but in this case, the rider will not suffer damage for doing so.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Rider","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"OZs6Ju3ojwCKJYuQ","name":"◯Elevated Attack","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Rider","featureType":"stunt","requirement":"Stunt, Level 1 Rider Required","cost":"","metadata":"Prerequisite: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stunt:elevated-attack","description":"Compatible: Animals, Mythical Beasts, Magitech\n\nArea: None\n\nWhen riding a mount, this Stunt increases the physical damage done by the jockey by +1. This includes not only melee attacks but any ranged attacks and thrown weapons as well.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Rider","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"PaYO11HMCCCUq8W9","name":"Spirit Domain: Vanishment","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Geomancer","featureType":"aspect","requirement":"Aspect, 10th Level Geomancer Required","cost":"Spirit Qi 1 - 4","metadata":"Cost: Spirit Qi 1 - 4\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"spirit","qiMin":1,"qiMax":4,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/aspect:spirit-domain-vanishment","description":"This effect reduces the target's presence and makes it difficult for others to perceive.\n\nWhile this Aspect is active, any effect with a maximum number of targets that includes the target will automatically exclude it. Additionally, the target cannot be affected by \"Area: Line\" or \"Area: Breakthrough\" effects (it will not be hit randomly). Effects with \"/All\" or \"/Space\" will still affect the target as usual.\n\nThis effect lasts for the duration of the effect or until it has been triggered a number of times equal to the Spirit Qi consumed, after which it is lost.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Geomancer","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"PkgQwXnaPs4Onr5b","name":"⏩Flowing Fortunes III","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 5 Tactician Required","cost":"None","metadata":"Rank: Rank 3\nType: Evasion\nEdge Cost: None\nEdge Accumulation: +1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":1,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:flowing-fortunes-iii","description":"Issues commands to anticipate enemy attacks and directs movements to ensure the safety of allies.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), the targets gain a +2 bonus to Evasion checks.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"PzgMeOyd6XC7g8Ut","name":"⏩Efficiency II","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"maneuver","requirement":"Maneuver, Level 5 Tactician Required","cost":"5 Edge","metadata":"Conditions: [ Maneuver: Efficiency I ]\nPrerequisite: None (used with Minor Action)\nEdge Cost: 5 Edge","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":5},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/maneuver:efficiency-ii","description":"The Tactician uses carefully prepared incantations to enhance the effects of their spells.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), the Tactician gains either +7 to magic damage or +7 to HP recovery from their own spells. If multiple targets are affected by the spell, this bonus is applied to any character among them. Once the bonus is applied, the effect disappears.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"QW1DN3DeS1oaUfR6","name":"◯Long-Range Technique","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 5 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"-","metadata":"Cost: -\nPrerequisite: [ Spectral Throw ]","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:long-range-technique","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 5 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Extends the range of attacks using [Spectral Throw]\n\nWhen Dark Hunters use [ Spectral Throw ], it is changed to \"Range: 2 (original range +20m)\".","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"Qa94rr3myRGmTAZV","name":"◯Improved Enhance Mount","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Rider","featureType":"stunt","requirement":"Stunt, Level 10 Rider Required","cost":"","metadata":"Prerequisite: [ Enhance Mount ]","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stunt:improved-enhance-mount","description":"Compatible: Animals, Mythical Beasts, Magitech\n\nArea: Main or All\n\nWith this Stunt, the mount is significantly more mobile, increasing the mount's Accuracy and Evasion by an additional +1 (for a total of +2). If the mount has multiple sections, then only the Main section receives this bonus; if the mount is not multi-sectioned, then the whole mount will be affected.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Rider","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
