{"_id":"RzyqPG0pqUlhcd5C","name":"⏩Scale Leggings","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Enhancer","featureType":"technique","requirement":"Technique, Level 1 Enhancer Required","cost":"","metadata":"Duration: 1 hour","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/technique:scale-leggings","description":"Pale scales sprout from the user's body, allowing underwater free movement. The user is no longer affected by movement penalties in the water, can move freely, and does not receive any penalties for being in the water.\n\nThis technique does not allow for breathing while underwater.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Enhancer","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"S0dqR52lMeDUeSlH","name":"Cacophony","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Bard","featureType":"spellsong","requirement":"Spellsong, Level 1 Bard Required","cost":"","metadata":"Singing: Not Required\nPet: Bird, Frog, Insect\nEffect Condition: None\nResistance: Negates\nType: Psychic\nBase Rhythm: ⮯1\nFlourish Value: 13\nExtra Rhythm: ⮯1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":1,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":1,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/spellsong:cacophony","description":"This horrible racket disrupts the concentration of all within the area of effect, making it very difficult to cast any magic. Characters receive a -1 penalty for all Spellcasting checks.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Bard","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"SMV6YA1NrcaMQGkh","name":"◯Universal Manipulation","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 5 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"-","metadata":"Cost: -\nPrerequisite: [ Spectral Throw ]","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:universal-manipulation","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 5 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Ability to use melee weapons (1H only) for [Spectral Throw]\n\nDark Hunter can use melee weapons with \"Stance: 1H (excluding 1HR)\" for [ Spectral Throw ] at \"Range: 1 (10m),\" except for weapons in category Wrestling. If [ Long-Range Technique ] is acquired, the range becomes \"Range: 2 (30m).\"\n\nRegardless of the original weapon category, rank restriction removal and Extra Damage increase are determined by the rank of [ Weapon Proficiency/Thrown Weapon ].","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"TI2qFFTiTBLxX8iz","name":"⏩Critical Ray","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Alchemist","featureType":"evocation","requirement":"Evocation, 1st Level Alchemist Required","cost":"Gold","metadata":"Cards: Gold\nTarget: 1 character\nRange/Area: Touch\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)\nResistance: Optional","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"gold","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/evocation:critical-ray","description":"This evocation makes the target's weapons, arms, etc., glow, increasing their offensive power.\n\nWhen the target performs a melee or ranged attack which does physical damage, the 2d roll on the Power Table is increased by the factor below. The attack will be critical if the effect is greater than or equal to the Critical Threshold.\n\nFor fixed-value characters, their damage will be increased by this amount instead.\n\nWhen using the Power Table, the roll cannot be higher than 12. Also, this effect can only increase the first roll, and is lost immediately afterward (i.e. it does not apply to additional rolls on a critical).\n\nB: Roll +1\n\nA: Roll +2\n\nS: Roll +3\n\nSS: Roll +6","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Alchemist","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"Tl4C5ULiIzChm6k5","name":"⏩Chic Chick","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Enhancer","featureType":"technique","requirement":"Technique, Level 1 Enhancer Required","cost":"","metadata":"Duration: 1 hour","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/technique:chic-chick","description":"A small bird's wings sprout from the user's back, aiding them in aerial movement.\n\nWhen making Jump checks (see CR I, p. 112), the user receives a +5 bonus for those checks. Additionally, reduce any fall damage the user takes by -20.\n\nThis technique does not allow the user to fly.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Enhancer","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"TrWcitgVqtUpWFSb","name":"Heavenly Domain: Deflecting Skies","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Geomancer","featureType":"aspect","requirement":"Aspect, 1st Level Geomancer Required","cost":"Heavenly Qi 2","metadata":"Cost: Heavenly Qi 2\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"heavenly","qiMin":2,"qiMax":2,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/aspect:heavenly-domain-deflecting-skies","description":"Clouds shield the sky, making the target immune from the sun's influence.\n\nThe target is treated as unaffected by sunlight during the duration of the effect, whether outdoors or indoors. At the same time, it has [Lightning Immunity] for the duration of the effect.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Geomancer","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"TvKuUzb28L7YBNPd","name":"Spirit Domain: Mana Siphon","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Geomancer","featureType":"aspect","requirement":"Aspect, 5th Level Geomancer Required","cost":"Spirit Qi 1 - 4","metadata":"Cost: Spirit Qi 1 - 4\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)\nType: Curse","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"spirit","qiMin":1,"qiMax":4,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/aspect:spirit-domain-mana-siphon","description":"Inhibits the target from casting spells. For the duration of the effect, the target has all Magic Power scores reduced by (Spirit Qi consumed) points.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Geomancer","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"UBUTzbcA3d4arPRW","name":"⏩Resistance I","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"maneuver","requirement":"Maneuver, Level 1 Tactician Required","cost":"3 Edge","metadata":"Conditions: -\nPrerequisite: None (used with Minor Action)\nEdge Cost: 3 Edge","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":3},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/maneuver:resistance-i","description":"The Tactician can predict enemy magic and unique skills and prepare for them.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), the Tactician gains a +3 bonus to either their Fortitude or Willpower.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"UXZeJZkhptn3NN3y","name":"⏩Flowing Fortunes I","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 1 Tactician Required","cost":"None","metadata":"Rank: Rank 1\nType: Evasion\nEdge Cost: None\nEdge Accumulation: +1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":1,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:flowing-fortunes-i","description":"Commands a move to avoid enemy attacks.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), the targets gain a +1 bonus to Evasion checks; a target who makes even one Evasion check loses this effect.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"UtPP5f1zCCO5BfuF","name":"⏩Spectral Curve","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 5 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"1dHP","metadata":"Cost: 1dHP\nPrerequisite: [ Pull of Soul Tethers ]\nTarget: Caster\nRange/Area: Caster\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)\nResistance: Optional","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"1d","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:spectral-curve","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 5 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Allows Thrown Attack to be performed as \"Area: Line\"\n\nWeapons thrown by the Dark Hunter trace an arc, cleaving everything in their path.\n\nThrown Attacks by the Dark Hunter (including [ Spectral Throw ]) are treated as \"Area: Line \". In Advanced Combat (see ET, p. 78), an ellipse of any shape (from a circle to essentially a straight line) is drawn with the target and the Dark Hunter at each end of the long axis, representing the flying path of the thrown weapon. The effective range is 1m wide on either side of this path (even if there's overlap in the path due to back-and-forth motion, characters caught in the effect are only checked once).\n\nNote that for weapons or effects that are lost upon being thrown or hit, damage and effects are only applied to the first target hit (determined by the GM considering the path), and other targets are not hit (in other words, using this Essence Weaving with such weapons would be pointless).\n\nThrown weapons return to the Dark Hunter's hand. For normal thrown weapons, the equipped state is maintained.\n\nOnce this effect occurs, the [Spectral Curve] is automatically canceled.\n\nIts effects do not stack with [ Dual Weaving ]. If [Dual Weaving] or [Spectral Curve] is in effect and these Essence Weavings are used again, the effects are overwritten each time, with only the last one being applied.\n\nThe Accuracy check is performed only once, collectively. The HP consumption when using [Spectral Throw] remains normal and does not double.\n\nDamage determination for targets is done individually.\n\nWhen performing two thrown weapon attacks with [ Dual Wielding ] (note: as mentioned earlier, this cannot be done with [Dual Weaving]), [Spectral Curve] can be used separately for each attack (costs are also determined and consumed separately for each). If you haven't learned [ Twin Strike ], the targets of the two attacks (and the weapon's flying path in Advanced Combat) must be the same. If the target is defeated (removed from the game) by the first attack, the area or coordinates where it existed automatically become the target, and other characters (sections) in that location cannot be chosen as targets.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"Vk031DZtyFMhCLoE","name":"Banquet of Flowers","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Bard","featureType":"finale","requirement":"Finale, Level 5 Bard Required","cost":"⮯2♡2","metadata":"Rhythm Cost: ⮯2♡2\nResistance: Optional\nType: -","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":2,"enchanting":2},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/finale:banquet-of-flowers","description":"The MP of up to 3 target characters will be restored by Power 10 + Bardic Power points.\n\nThe effect of [Finale: Banquet of Flowers] can be received only once per target character per day. Undead, Magitech, and Constructs cannot be affected by this Finale.\n\n10 1 1 2 3 3 4 5 5 6 7 None\n\nPower Table (Power 10, Critical —)\n3: 1  |  4: 1  |  5: 2  |  6: 3  |  7: 3  |  8: 4  |  9: 5  |  10: 5  |  11: 6  |  12: 7","mpCost":0,"power":10,"powerTable":{"3":1,"4":1,"5":2,"6":3,"7":3,"8":4,"9":5,"10":5,"11":6,"12":7},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":true,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Bard","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"VzVWNK4TfuMD4pUe","name":"⏩Balloon Seed Shot","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Enhancer","featureType":"technique","requirement":"Technique, Level 10 Enhancer Required","cost":"","metadata":"Duration: 30 seconds (3 rounds)","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/technique:balloon-seed-shot","description":"The Enhancer can literally spit out an equipped thrown weapon from their mouth with a Minor Action and attack with it only once per 10 seconds (1 round). The Accuracy check of this attack is made with Enhancer level + Dexterity Modifier, and Extra Damage equals Enhancer level + Strength Modifier.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Enhancer","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"W4ShD0lNC9Pb1iiu","name":"Slash Field","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Alchemist","featureType":"evocation","requirement":"Evocation, 10th Level Alchemist Required","cost":"White x 3","metadata":"Cards: White x 3\nTarget: All Areas (30m radius) / Space\nRange/Area: Touch\nDuration: Special\nResistance: Can't","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":3,"suggestedCardColor":"white","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/evocation:slash-field","description":"All characters within the area become immune to all damage and effects of the Slashing type. At the same time, if a character receives physical or magical damage of the Bludgeoning type, the damage received is increased by +5 points.\n\nThe duration varies depending on the rank of the material card consumed.\n\nB: None\n\nA: 10 seconds (1 round)\n\nS: 30 seconds (3 rounds)\n\nSS: 3 minutes (18 rounds)","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Alchemist","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"WIX2pisB72l3EstW","name":"Break","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Bard","featureType":"spellsong","requirement":"Spellsong, Level 5 Bard Required","cost":"","metadata":"Singing: Not Required\nPet: Frog, Insect\nEffect Condition: None\nResistance: Negates\nType: Psychic\nBase Rhythm: ⮯2\nFlourish Value: 18\nExtra Rhythm: ⮯1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":2,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":1,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/spellsong:break","description":"The melody is jarring and distracts the listener's concentration. The target receives a -1 penalty to Fortitude and Willpower Checks.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Bard","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"WvrWdTnz1VMkn1yc","name":"⏩△Affliction Ward","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 5 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"1dHP","metadata":"Cost: 1dHP\nPrerequisite: None\nTarget: Caster\nRange/Area: Caster\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)\nResistance: Optional","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"1d","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:affliction-ward","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 5 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: +2 resistance to poison, disease, and curse\n\nFor the duration of the effect, when the Dark Hunter performs a resistance check against Poison-, Disease-, or Curse-type effects or damage, they can add +2 to their Success Value.\n\nWhen the user's Dark Hunter class reaches level 10, they become completely immune to Poison-, Disease-, and Curse-type effects or damage (even those with \"Resistance: Can't\" or \"Resistance: Temporary\") if they are generated by the unique skills or magic use of characters classified as \" Daemon \" or \" Undead .\"","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"X8FORCh9Ti1woyXu","name":"Chorus","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Bard","featureType":"spellsong","requirement":"Spellsong, Level 10 Bard Required","cost":"","metadata":"Singing: Required\nPet: -\nEffect Condition: ♡6\nResistance: Negates\nType: Psychic\nBase Rhythm: ♡2\nFlourish Value: 24\nExtra Rhythm: ♡2","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":2},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":2},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/spellsong:chorus","description":"Targets sing along with the Bard. A target can only perform a Limited Move as a type of movement and cannot cast spells that require vocalization, give verbal commands or instructions, or say a password.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Bard","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"XFMoBaQ3zsmVxQyH","name":"⏩Surging Offense III: True Aim","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 5 Tactician Required","cost":"None","metadata":"Rank: Rank 3\nType: Attack\nEdge Cost: None\nEdge Accumulation: +1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":1,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:surging-offense-iii-true-aim","description":"Commands a stance that inflicts damage to the enemy with precision and certainty.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), the targets gain a +1 bonus to Accuracy checks and +1 point to physical damage when making melee or ranged attacks.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"Y2d4Y0RdRCHN5d1G","name":"◯Improved Elevated Attack","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Rider","featureType":"stunt","requirement":"Stunt, Level 5 Rider Required","cost":"","metadata":"Prerequisite: Elevated Attack","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stunt:improved-elevated-attack","description":"Compatible: Animals, Mythical Beasts, Magitech\n\nArea: None\n\nWhen riding a mount, this Stunt further increases the physical damage done by the jockey by +1, to a total of +2 damage. This includes not only melee attacks but any ranged attacks and thrown weapons as well.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Rider","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"YAjHaaDiPnky3Wgy","name":"⏩Secret Revival","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 5 Tactician Required","cost":"None","metadata":"Rank: Rank 2\nType: Inspirational\nEdge Cost: None\nEdge Accumulation: +1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":1,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:secret-revival","description":"Tell the characteristics of the monster again and stimulate the memory of allies.\n\nWhen the Tactician uses this Stratagem, the Tactician specifies an enemy monster in combat. As soon as this Stratagem takes effect, each target can immediately make a Monster Knowledge check against the monster designated by the Tactician, regardless of its turn.\n\nThe Tactician using this Stratagem may choose to use a Rank 3 Stratagem of any type in the next round.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
