{"_id":"YYOOG5InsnQarDU5","name":"⏩Flowing Fortunes II","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 1 Tactician Required","cost":"None","metadata":"Rank: Rank 2\nType: Evasion\nEdge Cost: None\nEdge Accumulation: +1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":1,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:flowing-fortunes-ii","description":"Commands to read enemy's movements and directs targets to evade easily.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), the targets gain a +1 bonus to Evasion checks.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"ZQvBPWP81Wedc0uX","name":"⏩△Mind Binding Technique III","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 10 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"1dHP","metadata":"Cost: 1dHP\nPrerequisite: [ Mind Binding Technique II ]\nTarget: 1 Character\nRange/Area: Touch\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)\nResistance: Can't","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"1d","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:mind-binding-technique-iii","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 10 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Action checks -1\n\nUses the power of the mind to bind the target's movement. For the duration of the effect, the target receives a -1 penalty on all action checks. It cannot overlap with [Mind Binding Technique I/II], so the effect cannot be stacked (the last one used is effective).","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"a5b8QAnMQ3GXslHf","name":"◯Lion's Fury","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Rider","featureType":"stunt","requirement":"Stunt, Level 5 Rider Required","cost":"","metadata":"Prerequisite: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stunt:lions-fury","description":"Compatible: Animals, Mythical Beasts, Magitech\n\nArea: All\n\nIf the mount has multiple sections, any two of them can perform a Major Action. A jockey can also perform Major Actions separately.\n\nIf more than one section takes a Major Action due to this effect, the later section(s) receive a -2 penalty on Evasion checks for the following 10 seconds (1 round).","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Rider","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"aicdeEm4JEIvDSS4","name":"►Evil-Banishing Light Lance","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 10 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"2dHP","metadata":"Cost: 2dHP\nPrerequisite: [ Evil-Banishing Light Bullet ]\nTarget: 1 Character\nRange/Area: 1 (10m) / Shot\nDuration: Instant\nResistance: Half","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"2d","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:evil-banishing-light-lance","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 10 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Power 30 Energy-type magical damage (Power 60 against Daemons and Undead)\n\nCreates a lance of light and launches it at the enemy. It has no maximum cost limit and is the same as [ Evil-Banishing Light Bullet ] except that its Power is 30 (60 against Daemons and Undead ).\n\n30 2 4 4 6 7 8 9 10 10 10 ⑩\n\n60 5 9 10 11 12 13 14 15 16 18 ⑩\n\nPower Table (Power 30, Critical 10)\n3: 2  |  4: 4  |  5: 4  |  6: 6  |  7: 7  |  8: 8  |  9: 9  |  10: 10  |  11: 10  |  12: 10","mpCost":0,"power":30,"powerTable":{"3":2,"4":4,"5":4,"6":6,"7":7,"8":8,"9":9,"10":10,"11":10,"12":10},"critical":10,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":true,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"amyWBtJ9lc6NMYH5","name":"⏩Finding Flaws","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 1 Tactician Required","cost":"None","metadata":"Rank: Rank 1\nType: Inspirational\nEdge Cost: None\nEdge Accumulation: +1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":1,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:finding-flaws","description":"Gives instructions to strike the enemy's weak point more efficiently.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), the targets gain a +1 to Extra Damage for detected weak points against enemies. The Tactician using this Stratagem may choose to use a Rank 2 Stratagem of any type in the next round.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"axcyy6iCoK441Pal","name":"Heavenly Domain: Guiding Winds","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Geomancer","featureType":"aspect","requirement":"Aspect, 5th Level Geomancer Required","cost":"Heavenly Qi 1 - 4","metadata":"Cost: Heavenly Qi 1 - 4\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"heavenly","qiMin":1,"qiMax":4,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/aspect:heavenly-domain-guiding-winds","description":"Winds change the trajectory of ammunition and thrown weapons, guiding them to their mark.\n\nIf the target makes a Ranged Attack during the duration, its Accuracy check is increased by (Heavenly Qi consumed) points.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Geomancer","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"bNyqNyUCV4Qpd7CO","name":"⏩Recovery","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Enhancer","featureType":"technique","requirement":"Technique, Level 5 Enhancer Required","cost":"","metadata":"Duration: Instant","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/technique:recovery","description":"The user can refresh themselves and recover an amount of HP equal to their Enhancer Level.\n\nThis technique can be used once per round.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Enhancer","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"bXwR7C0lwmrwUf95","name":"Earthly Domain: Shifting Energies","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Geomancer","featureType":"aspect","requirement":"Aspect, 5th Level Geomancer Required","cost":"Earthly Qi 3","metadata":"Cost: Earthly Qi 3\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)\nType: Curse","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"earthly","qiMin":3,"qiMax":3,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/aspect:earthly-domain-shifting-energies","description":"This ability removes attribute types from the target's surroundings. As a result, the target will not be able to deal physical or magical damage of any type (meaning damage with a specified type, either in the spell or effect description) for the duration of the effect. In return, the target will be immune to any physical, magical, or fixed damage with a Type of its own.\n\nThe target is not immune to purely physical, untyped damage.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Geomancer","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"bfeKUnXXKJlHVsfC","name":"⏩Efficiency I","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"maneuver","requirement":"Maneuver, Level 1 Tactician Required","cost":"3 Edge","metadata":"Conditions: -\nPrerequisite: None (used with Minor Action)\nEdge Cost: 3 Edge","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":3},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/maneuver:efficiency-i","description":"The Tactician uses a prepared incantation to enhance a spell's effect.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), the Tactician adds +4 to magic damage dealt or +4 to HP restored by their own actions. If there are multiple targets that would benefit from the magic damage or HP restoration, this bonus applies to only one character of the Tactician's choice. The effect ends once the bonus has been applied.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"bsjHBnl22KN1yn3x","name":"⏩Unexpected Blow I","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"maneuver","requirement":"Maneuver, Level 1 Tactician Required","cost":"3 Edge","metadata":"Conditions: -\nPrerequisite: None (used with Minor Action)\nEdge Cost: 3 Edge","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":3},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/maneuver:unexpected-blow-i","description":"The Tactician demonstrates a strategy to take advantage of the enemy's weakness.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), when the Tactician makes a melee or ranged attack, they gain a +2 bonus to Accuracy checks and +2 points of physical damage dealt per attack. This effect is lost after one use.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"dCz7hHi5N4dJNX1K","name":"△Initiative Boost","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Alchemist","featureType":"evocation","requirement":"Evocation, 5th Level Alchemist Required","cost":"Red x 2","metadata":"Cards: Red x 2\nTarget: 1 character\nRange/Area: Touch\nDuration: Instant\nResistance: Optional","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":2,"suggestedCardColor":"red","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/evocation:initiative-boost","description":"Increases the reaction speed of the target and the success value of their Initiative check.\n\nIf this Evocation is used for other characters in Combat Preparation, the alchemist and target must be placed in the same position (area, coordinate) during initial placement at the start of the battle.\n\nB: +1 bonus\n\nA: +2 bonus\n\nS: +4 bonus\n\nSS: +8 bonus","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Alchemist","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"dgJq5dZz5gALshpp","name":"◯Improved HP Enhancement","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Rider","featureType":"stunt","requirement":"Stunt, Level 5 Rider Required","cost":"","metadata":"Prerequisite: [ HP Enhancement ]","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stunt:improved-hp-enhancement","description":"Compatible: Animals, Mythical Beasts\n\nArea: All\n\nIncrease the Maximum HP of all sections of the mount by 5 points (total +10).","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Rider","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"duiX5QQDpBy58WvT","name":"◯Mass Looting","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"-","metadata":"Cost: -\nPrerequisite: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:mass-looting","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Obtain 1d of a single automatically acquired loot item worth 100/1,000/10,000G or less.\n\nWhen a Dark Hunter attempts to obtain loot from a monster, if there is an item with a selling price of \"100G or less\" that is \"Always\" obtained, they gain \"1d\" of one such item.\n\nIf there's one item, they get 1d of it; if there are two items, they get 1d+1. If the original amount was 1d, roll 1d to determine the quantity, then change one of those to 1d (or alternatively, calculate it as 2d-1 from the start). If multiple types of automatically obtained loot meet the conditions, this is applied to one type of their choice.\n\nWhen the Dark Hunter reaches level 5, the selling price requirement becomes \"1,000G or less;\" at level 10, it becomes \"10,000G or less.\"\n\nThis effect does not apply to Boss Class Monsters (see p. 130, BM, p. 158) or to \"Always\" loot specially set in scenarios.\n\nIt is limited to those items pre-set in the general monster data.\n\nIt does not affect the quantity of non-automatic loot obtained at all. The effect cannot be applied when obtaining loot through special methods such as Auto Looter (see ET, p. 143).","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"e5CckmL33GL7KZZG","name":"►Soul Tethers Hands II","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 10 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"2dHP","metadata":"Cost: 2dHP\nPrerequisite: [ Soul Tethers Hands I ]\nTarget: Caster\nRange/Area: Caster\nDuration: Instant/1 minute (6 rounds)\nResistance: N/A","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"2d","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:soul-tethers-hands-ii","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 10 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Treat two Soul Tethers as arms.\n\nThis has the same effect as [ Soul Tethers Hands I ], but the Dark Hunter extends two Soul Tethers, allowing them to manipulate objects as if using both hands. They can wield weapons with the \"Stance: 2H\", but they cannot benefit from the effects of [ Dual Wielding ].","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"enQtHqIseMBXHhpN","name":"⏩Ironclad Defense IV: Castle Armor","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 5 Tactician Required","cost":"None","metadata":"Rank: Rank 4\nType: Defense\nEdge Cost: None\nEdge Accumulation: +2","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":2,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:ironclad-defense-iv-castle-armor","description":"Commands an efficient defense with the Tactician's next move in mind.\n\nThe target's Defense is increased by +3 for 10 seconds (1 round).","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"esNTfVMDwduxHR1L","name":"⏩Fire Breath","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Enhancer","featureType":"technique","requirement":"Technique, Level 5 Enhancer Required","cost":"","metadata":"Duration: 30 seconds (3 rounds)\nTarget: 1 area (3m Radius) / 5\nRange/Area: 1 (10m) / Shot\nType: Fire","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/technique:fire-breath","description":"As a Major Action, the user can breathe fire in front of them.\n\nAttack Roll: Enhancer Level + Intelligence Modifier\n\nResist: Half\n\nDeals Power 10 + (Enhancer Level + Intelligence Modifier) Fire magic damage. If the user has the Combat Feats [ Magic Convergence ] or [ Magic Control ], they can apply it to this technique. However, the Combat Feat [ Metamagic/Area ] has no effect.\n\n10 1 1 2 3 3 4 5 5 6 7 ⑩\n\nPower Table (Power 10, Critical 10)\n3: 1  |  4: 1  |  5: 2  |  6: 3  |  7: 3  |  8: 4  |  9: 5  |  10: 5  |  11: 6  |  12: 7","mpCost":0,"power":10,"powerTable":{"3":1,"4":1,"5":2,"6":3,"7":3,"8":4,"9":5,"10":5,"11":6,"12":7},"critical":10,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":true,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Enhancer","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"fSrI3rCCzfmgn89U","name":"⏩Overdrive","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Rider","featureType":"stunt","requirement":"Stunt, Level 10 Rider Required","cost":"","metadata":"Prerequisite: [ Limit Drive ]","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stunt:overdrive","description":"Compatible: Magitech\n\nArea: All\n\nThis Stunt should be used immediately before using [ Limit Drive ]. The bonus to the mount's Accuracy check from the [ Limit Drive ] used immediately after is increased by an additional +2 (+4 total), and the increment to physical damage is an additional +4 (+8 total). The penalty for an Evasion check and the need for recalibration for 10 minutes remain the same.\n\nWhen [Overdrive] is used, all sections of the jockey and mount take 10 points of fixed damage to HP at the end of their turn.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Rider","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"fWrYANNhIXTuQVQM","name":"◯Monster Watch","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"-","metadata":"Cost: -\nPrerequisite: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:monster-watch","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Extend Monster Knowledge checks to include Barbarous and Undead\n\nThe Monster Knowledge check performed by the Dark Hunter class will be expanded from \"Daemon-only\" to include \"Daemons, Barbarous, and Undead.\" A character can understand the classification and perform a Monster Knowledge check if the target has the \"Classification: Daemon ,\" \"Classification: Barbarous ,\" or \"Classification: Undead \" (if there's no mimicry or transformation in effect).\n\nWhen a user's Dark Hunter class level reaches 5 or higher, in this Monster Knowledge check, if the target has the \"Classification: Daemon,\" the Weakness is treated as 4 points lower than usual (but will not decrease below the monster's Reputation score). This effect is cumulative with the \" Lal-Veine's Monocle \" (see ET, p. 154), but Weakness will still not drop below Reputation.\n\nIf a user's Dark Hunter class level is 10 or higher, and if the Success Value of the Monster Knowledge check against a monster of the relevant classification is equal to or greater than its Weakness score, the numerical value is doubled when applying the Weak Point. This is limited to cases where the Dark Hunter themselves achieves a Success Value equal to or greater than the Weakness in a Monster Knowledge check using the Dark Hunter class, and it only applies to themselves. This effect does not stack with the Combat Feat [ Weakness Exploit ].","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"fert2s1FIIxXVs3g","name":"⏩△Troll Vitals","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Enhancer","featureType":"technique","requirement":"Technique, Level 10 Enhancer Required","cost":"","metadata":"Duration: 30 seconds (3 rounds)","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/technique:troll-vitals","description":"The Enhancer becomes as strong as a Troll . If the Enhancer receives magic damage for the duration of the effect, it is reduced by 4 points.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Enhancer","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"g5woV2RsDk11kzEj","name":"⏩Careful Guard I","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"maneuver","requirement":"Maneuver, Level 1 Tactician Required","cost":"3 Edge","metadata":"Conditions: -\nPrerequisite: None (used with Minor Action)\nEdge Cost: 3 Edge","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":3},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/maneuver:careful-guard-i","description":"The Tactician predicts all enemy attacks against them.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), when the Tactician receives physical or magical damage, the damage is reduced by 4 points. Note that Poison-, Disease-, or Curse-type damage cannot be reduced.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"gCWGyZVTOFB6WG7D","name":"⏩Hymn of the Brave","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 5 Tactician Required","cost":"None","metadata":"Rank: Rank 1\nType: Inspirational\nEdge Cost: None\nEdge Accumulation: +1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":1,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:hymn-of-the-brave","description":"This Stratagem can exceptionally target the Tactician themselves.\n\nThis Stratagem adds lyrics to a Spellsong and limits the targets to which the effect can be applied.\n\nThe Tactician can now specify whether the effect should be applied to an \"enemy\" or \"friend.\" For 10 seconds (1 round), Spellsong effects used by the Tactician will only affect the side specified by the Tactician.\n\nThe Tactician using this Stratagem may choose to use a Rank 2 Stratagem of any type in the next round.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"gIqthF1bN11pp9hG","name":"⏩Daemonfinger","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Enhancer","featureType":"technique","requirement":"Technique, Level 5 Enhancer Required","cost":"","metadata":"Duration: 10 seconds (1 round)","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/technique:daemonfinger","description":"The user's hands become incredibly flexible and supple like a daemon. The user increases their Dexterity score by +6.\n\nFor fixed-value characters, their Accuracy increases by +1. GM is free to make other modifications at their discretion.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Enhancer","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"gQ32aIBbSlhNXPCL","name":"⏩Great Challenge","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 10 Tactician Required","cost":"1 Edge","metadata":"Rank: Rank 2\nType: Inspirational\nEdge Cost: 1 Edge\nEdge Accumulation: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":1},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:great-challenge","description":"This Stratagem exceptionally also targets the Tactician.\n\nYou make your presence known with a loud voice, attracting the attention of the enemy with your seemingly defenseless stance.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), targets except the Tactician gain a +1 bonus to Evasion checks and Fortitude and Willpower checks.\n\nAt the same time, for 10 seconds (1 round), the Tactician takes a penalty of -3 to Evasion checks and Fortitude and Willpower checks.\n\nThe Tactician using this Stratagem may choose to use a Rank 3 Stratagem of any type in the next round.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"gT9fk6LFjN5a6CT9","name":"⏩Animal Shape","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Enhancer","featureType":"technique","requirement":"Technique, Level 5 Enhancer Required","cost":"","metadata":"Duration: 1 hour","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/technique:animal-shape","description":"The user transforms into an animal common in society, such as a horse, pig, cat, or dog. The user cannot transform while wearing weapons, armor, or costumes.\n\nAfter the transformation, the user's ability scores remain the same. The user can still speak and use skills, but cannot hold items or weapons nor wear armor or clothing. The user can only attack with Punch .\n\nThis technique does not allow the user to communicate with animals.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Enhancer","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"gbyMIxNv1OfH97kw","name":"Enhanced Magic Sword A","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Heritor","featureType":"infusion","requirement":"[ Weapon Proficiency A / ]","cost":"","metadata":"Prerequisite: [ Weapon Proficiency A / ]","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/infusion:enhanced-magic-sword-a","description":"Applicable Section: N/A\n\nHuman Form: Yes\n\nSummary: Enhance Drake's Magic Sword to A rank\n\nEffect: Change Drake's Magic Sword to any A rank melee weapon of the master's choice. They cannot change it into a magic weapon, special product, or school equipment.\n\nIn order to handle this magic sword, the master must have acquired the [ Weapon Proficiency A/ ] Combat Feat in the corresponding category.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Heritor","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"gke9rhVqr9uMoYyt","name":"◯Greater Elevated Attack","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Rider","featureType":"stunt","requirement":"Stunt, Level 10 Rider Required","cost":"","metadata":"Prerequisite: [ Improved Elevated Attack ]","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stunt:greater-elevated-attack","description":"Compatible: Animals, Mythical Beasts, Magitech\n\nArea: None\n\nWhen riding a mount, this Stunt further increases the physical damage done by the jockey by +2, to a total of +4 damage. This includes not only melee attacks but any ranged attacks and thrown weapons as well.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Rider","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"h90iLqCpZm49U9uP","name":"⏩Defiant Stand III","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 5 Tactician Required","cost":"None","metadata":"Rank: Rank 3\nType: Resistance\nEdge Cost: None\nEdge Accumulation: +1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":1,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:defiant-stand-iii","description":"The Tactician inspires their allies and prepares them for enemy magic and special attacks.\n\nWhen using Stratagem, the Tactician specifies Fortitude or Willpower; for 10 seconds (1 round), the targets gain a +2 bonus to the specified check.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"hGOFjLIzhthmsWGp","name":"◯Enhance Mount","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Rider","featureType":"stunt","requirement":"Stunt, Level 1 Rider Required","cost":"","metadata":"Prerequisite: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stunt:enhance-mount","description":"Compatible: Animals, Mythical Beasts, Magitech\n\nArea: Main or All\n\nThis Stunt tightens the control the Rider has over the mount, increasing the mount's Accuracy and Evasion by +1. If the mount has multiple Sections, only the Main Section receives such a bonus; if the mount is not multi-Sectioned, then the whole mount will be affected.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Rider","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"hHkJWJyZUmmXz4ci","name":"Love Song","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Bard","featureType":"spellsong","requirement":"Spellsong, Level 5 Bard Required","cost":"","metadata":"Singing: Required\nPet: -\nEffect Condition: ⮭6♡6\nResistance: Negates\nType: Psychic (Weak)\nBase Rhythm: ♡2\nFlourish Value: 18\nExtra Rhythm: ⮭1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":2},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":1,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/spellsong:love-song","description":"This buoyant ballad stimulates romance, causing \"love to be in the air.\" Affected listeners will look to be with the closest partner of their choice, with current lovers/spouses taking precedence over random people. If current partners are not nearby, the closest available partner for the listener's orientation will be subject to these magically enhanced feelings, regardless of race. If no applicable partners are within the area of effect, the Spellsong has no effect.\n\nThose with budding romantic feelings will attempt to see if the partner reciprocates these feelings, while current partners will attempt to retire to act on these feelings.\n\nThe effects of this Spellsong last 1 hour, even if Bard stops performing.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Bard","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"hTef35Axlyf6QF5p","name":"Trance","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Bard","featureType":"spellsong","requirement":"Spellsong, Level 5 Bard Required","cost":"","metadata":"Singing: Not Required\nPet: Bird, Frog, Insect\nEffect Condition: None\nResistance: Can't\nType: Psychic\nBase Rhythm: ⮭2\nFlourish Value: 18\nExtra Rhythm: ⮭1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":2,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":1,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/spellsong:trance","description":"This is a clear melody that sharpens the mind of the listener. Those affected by this Spellsong gain a +1 bonus modifier to Spellcasting Checks.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Bard","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"hzxqT1BSLys5xLN6","name":"⏩△Antibody","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Enhancer","featureType":"technique","requirement":"Technique, Level 1 Enhancer Required","cost":"","metadata":"Duration: 30 seconds (3 rounds)","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/technique:antibody","description":"The user of this Technique strengthens their immune system, driving off poisons and diseases.\n\nWhen rolling a Fortitude or Willpower check for a Poison-type or Disease-type effect, the user gets a +4 bonus to that check.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Enhancer","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"iEc3BHAEnjM9hBmK","name":"►Mounted Command","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Rider","featureType":"stunt","requirement":"Stunt, Level 10 Rider Required","cost":"","metadata":"Prerequisite: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stunt:mounted-command","description":"Compatible: Animals, Mythical Beasts, Magitech\n\nArea: None\n\nThe jockey judges the battle situation and gives instructions to their teammates. This Stunt can only be performed with a Major Action while the jockey is on the jockey's mount. All characters (including mounts) within all areas (30m radius) that the jockey designates (as long as the characters accept it) gain a +2 bonus to Accuracy checks for 10 seconds (1 round). The Mount can still perform a Major Action this round.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Rider","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"iJW2o9qxCagNqn0X","name":"⏩Surging Offense V: Hellfire","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 10 Tactician Required","cost":"5 Edge","metadata":"Rank: Rank 5\nType: Attack\nEdge Cost: 5 Edge\nEdge Accumulation: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":5},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:surging-offense-v-hellfire","description":"Commands an explosive strategy that will end enemies once and for all.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), the targets gain +6 to physical damage when making melee or ranged attacks.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"iTMQMA7KOxxkPji4","name":"Heavenly Domain: Invisible Pavilion","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Geomancer","featureType":"aspect","requirement":"Aspect, 1st Level Geomancer Required","cost":"Heavenly Qi 1 - 3","metadata":"Cost: Heavenly Qi 1 - 3\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"heavenly","qiMin":1,"qiMax":3,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/aspect:heavenly-domain-invisible-pavilion","description":"This ability creates an invisible cover above the target, limiting their ability to fly. The duration of the effect and its additional effects depend on the amount of Heavenly Qi used:\n\nUsing 1 point of Heavenly Qi will prevent the target from moving by flying. Additionally, the target will not be exposed to rain or snow falling from above.\n\nUsing 2 points of Heavenly Qi will also prevent the target from using or applying abilities like [ Sword's Grace/Wings Of The Wind ] or [〇Flying].\n\nUsing 3 points of Heavenly Qi will also cause the target to fall prone on the spot if they were flying at the time of the effect.\n\nNote that this effect has no impact on characters with multiple sections.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Geomancer","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"iXbHE10meT1kgXcB","name":"◯Mount's Devotion","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Rider","featureType":"stunt","requirement":"Stunt, Level 1 Rider Required","cost":"","metadata":"Prerequisite: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stunt:mounts-devotion","description":"Compatible: Animals, Mythical Beasts\n\nArea: Main\n\nWhen being ridden by a jockey at the same position (area, coordinate), if the jockey receives physical or magical damage that would reduce them to 0 HP or lower, the mount may take the damage instead. After determining the applied damage that would be dealt to the jockey, reduce the mount's HP by that much instead. If a mount has multiple sections, only the Main Section can be a substitute in this way.\n\nThis Stunt can only be used once per combat.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Rider","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"iZ0MnEfh7c7oBC4h","name":"⏩Defiant Stand V: Overflowing Life","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 10 Tactician Required","cost":"5 Edge","metadata":"Rank: Rank 5\nType: Resistance\nEdge Cost: 5 Edge\nEdge Accumulation: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":5},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:defiant-stand-v-overflowing-life","description":"Wake up allies who have fallen or fainted, or inspire other allies.\n\nAt the moment this Stratagem takes effect, the same effect as [ Awaken ] is applied to a target who is exceptionally unable to fight (unconscious, sleeping, etc.). However, it is treated as an effect of Stratagem, not a spell, with a success value of 0.\n\nTargets that are not subject to the [ Awaken ]-like effect of this Stratagem gain a +2 bonus to their Fortitude and Willpower checks for 10 seconds (1 round).","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"itmQPOOVLvpcsR8D","name":"◯Unique Skill Release","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Rider","featureType":"stunt","requirement":"Stunt, Level 5 Rider Required","cost":"","metadata":"Prerequisite: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stunt:unique-skill-release","description":"Compatible: Animals, Mythical Beasts, Magitech\n\nArea: Main or All or None\n\nThe jockey becomes familiar with the mount's movements and abilities and allows them to use their unique skills at will.\n\nWith this Stunt, a mount's unique skills with \" Prerequisite: Unique Skill Release\" can now be used. Additionally, unique skills with \" Enhance: Unique Skill Release\" can be used to their full extent.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Rider","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"j6KSh97SXhmieIID","name":"⏩Cat's Eyes","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Enhancer","featureType":"technique","requirement":"Technique, Level 1 Enhancer Required","cost":"","metadata":"Duration: 30 seconds (3 rounds)","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/technique:cats-eyes","description":"The user's pupils stretch vertically, allowing them to watch an opponent more carefully.\n\nThis increased observation gives the user a +1 bonus to Accuracy checks.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Enhancer","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
