{"_id":"jHCAw1rFt13mRuz6","name":"⏩Vivid Liquid","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Alchemist","featureType":"evocation","requirement":"Evocation, 5th Level Alchemist Required","cost":"Green x 2","metadata":"Cards: Green x 2\nTarget: 1 character\nRange/Area: Touch\nDuration: Instant\nResistance: Optional","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":2,"suggestedCardColor":"green","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/evocation:vivid-liquid","description":"Extracts the life force of the plant and restores the target's MP.\n\nB: None\n\nA: 3 MP\n\nS: 10 MP\n\nSS: 20 MP","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Alchemist","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"jmQsm4GyJ8uIqedv","name":"⏩Type Infusion: Roar","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"1dHP","metadata":"Cost: 1dHP\nPrerequisite: None\nTarget: 1 Character\nRange/Area: 2 (30m) / Target\nDuration: 30 seconds (3 rounds)\nResistance: Optional","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"1d","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:type-infusion-roar","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Make weapon attack Bludgeoning, Earth, and Fire types\n\nWhen the target makes a weapon attack, treat the weapon used in that attack as a Magic Weapon of Bludgeoning, Earth, and Fire types.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"kARqQdFbo2t7lN03","name":"⏩Intimidation","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Rider","featureType":"stunt","requirement":"Stunt, Level 1 Rider Required","cost":"","metadata":"Prerequisite: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stunt:intimidation","description":"Compatible: Animals, Mythical Beasts\n\nArea: Main\n\nThe mount stares at a target in the same skirmish with lethal intent, intimidating and frightening them. A contested roll is made between the Rider's Rider Class Level + Spirit Modifier against the target's Willpower. If the Stunt is successful, the target receives a -1 penalty to Accuracy, Spellcasting and any check of Unique Skills made with a Major Action for 10 seconds (1 round).\n\nThis is a Psychic-type effect and can only be performed once every 10 seconds (1 round).\n\nUsing this Stunt causes the mount to spend 5 MP.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Rider","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"kZaTuFcLnIi9KJmN","name":"Nostalgia","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Bard","featureType":"spellsong","requirement":"Spellsong, Level 5 Bard Required","cost":"","metadata":"Singing: Not Required\nPet: Bird, Frog, Insect\nEffect Condition: ⮯6♡6\nResistance: Negates\nType: Psychic (Weak)\nBase Rhythm: ⮯2\nFlourish Value: 18\nExtra Rhythm: ♡1","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":2,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":1},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/spellsong:nostalgia","description":"A wistful tune, this Spellsong invokes feelings of days long past in the hearts of its listeners, causing them to wish to go back home. If in combat, those affected by the Spellsong attempt to retreat from the battlefield and escape. This Spellsong has no effect if the listener is already at home or is unable to escape.\n\nOnce affected, listeners will be under the effects of this Spellsong for 1 hour. After 1 hour, or if the listener manages to return home, this Spellsong's effect ends.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Bard","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"l05OC8eLgz3BPbhF","name":"⏩△Mind Binding Technique II","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 5 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"1dHP","metadata":"Cost: 1dHP\nPrerequisite: [ Mind Binding Technique I ]\nTarget: 1 Character\nRange/Area: Touch\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)\nResistance: Can't","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"1d","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:mind-binding-technique-ii","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 5 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Active skill checks -1\n\nRestrain the target's movements using soul power.\n\nFor the effect duration, when the target performs an active check that involves a comparison of Success Values (such as Accuracy check, Spellcasting check for resistance, Performance check, Evocation check, etc.), they receive a -1 penalty to all of these checks. As this has the same name and is non-stacking with [Mind Binding Technique I/III], the effects cannot be combined (the last one used is effective).\n\nFor checks that could be considered active but do not involve a comparison of Success Values, or in comparisons where active and passive sides cannot be determined, or when acting as the passive side, this penalty does not apply.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"m8tsxhshFAuZGTPe","name":"⏩Ironclad Defense IV: Mirror Shield","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 5 Tactician Required","cost":"None","metadata":"Rank: Rank 4\nType: Defense\nEdge Cost: None\nEdge Accumulation: +2","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":2,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:ironclad-defense-iv-mirror-shield","description":"Issues commands to anticipate any damage with the Tactician's next move in mind.\n\nWhen physical or magical damage is applied to the targets within 10 seconds (1 round), the damage is reduced by -1 point. Note that Poison-, Disease-, or Curse-type damage cannot be reduced.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"mEG5uIhl38Ip890r","name":"⏩Concentration I","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"maneuver","requirement":"Maneuver, Level 1 Tactician Required","cost":"3 Edge","metadata":"Conditions: -\nPrerequisite: None (used with Minor Action)\nEdge Cost: 3 Edge","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":3},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/maneuver:concentration-i","description":"The Tactician uses a prepared incantation to increase their spell success rate.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), when the Tactician makes only one Spellcasting check, they gain a +1 bonus to the success value of the Spellcasting check. Once this bonus is applied, the effect disappears.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"mT4u8pyr1x0yvOAF","name":"⏩Unlock Needle","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Alchemist","featureType":"evocation","requirement":"Evocation, 5th Level Alchemist Required","cost":"Black x 2","metadata":"Cards: Black x 2\nTarget: 1 object\nRange/Area: Touch\nDuration: Instant\nResistance: Can't","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":2,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/evocation:unlock-needle","description":"The alchemist creates a thin needle that moves skillfully and disarms a target key or trap. The following success values are obtained depending on the rank of the material card consumed. Note that this item cannot be combined with items such as a Key Of Unlocking.\n\nB: 12\n\nA: 16\n\nS: 20\n\nSS: 40, and is treated as an Automatic Success","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Alchemist","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"meEVw8Fd51JL8lTD","name":"⏩Careful Guard II","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"maneuver","requirement":"Maneuver, Level 5 Tactician Required","cost":"5 Edge","metadata":"Conditions: [ Maneuver: Careful Guard I ]\nPrerequisite: None (used with Minor Action)\nEdge Cost: 5 Edge","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":5},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/maneuver:careful-guard-ii","description":"The Tactician predicts all enemy attacks against them.\n\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), when the Tactician receives physical or magical damage, that damage is reduced by 7 points. Note that Poison-, Disease-, or Curse-type damage cannot be reduced.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"mzWoBIvmO5dq7xDH","name":"⏩Dual Weaving","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 5 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"2HP","metadata":"Cost: 2HP\nPrerequisite: [ Spectral Throw ]\nTarget: Caster\nRange/Area: Caster\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)\nResistance: Optional","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"2","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:dual-weaving","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 5 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Set [Spectral Throw] attacks to \"Target: 2 characters\"\n\nWhen the Dark Hunter uses [ Spectral Throw ], it becomes \"Target: 2 Characters\". Two identical weapons must be prepared for the thrown weapon. Once this effect is used, [Dual Weaving] is automatically canceled.\n\nThe Accuracy check for [Spectral Throw] is performed only once collectively. Also, HP consumption remains normal when used and does not double.\n\nDamage determination against targets is done individually.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":5},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"n9Ey9hC6yBf1qcxe","name":"Heavenly Domain: Descending Thunder","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Geomancer","featureType":"aspect","requirement":"Aspect, 1st Level Geomancer Required","cost":"Heavenly Qi 1 - 4","metadata":"Cost: Heavenly Qi 1 - 4\nDuration: Instant 10 seconds (1 round)\nType: Lightning","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"heavenly","qiMin":1,"qiMax":4,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/aspect:heavenly-domain-descending-thunder","description":"Lightning strikes down from the heavens, dealing (Heavenly Qi consumed x 2) fixed damage to the target.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Geomancer","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"nhQoeVNRWI67OsAA","name":"⏩Type Infusion: Tear","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"1dHP","metadata":"Cost: 1dHP\nPrerequisite: None\nTarget: 1 Character\nRange/Area: 2 (30m) / Target\nDuration: 30 seconds (3 rounds)\nResistance: Optional","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"1d","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:type-infusion-tear","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Make weapon attack Slashing, Water/Ice, and Wind types\n\nWhen the target makes a weapon attack, treat the weapon used in that attack as a Magic Weapon of Slashing, Water/Ice, and Wind types.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"o9D2H7rCwa87Qdpr","name":"⏩Ironclad Defense V: Giant Wall","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Tactician","featureType":"stratagem","requirement":"Stratagem, Level 10 Tactician Required","cost":"5 Edge","metadata":"Rank: Rank 5\nType: Defense\nEdge Cost: 5 Edge\nEdge Accumulation: None","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":5},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/stratagem:ironclad-defense-v-giant-wall","description":"Commands measures to withstand any damage.\n\nWhen physical or magical damage is applied to the target within 10 seconds (1 round), the damage is reduced by 3 points. Note that Poison-, Disease-, or Curse-type damage cannot be reduced.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Tactician","level":10},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"oZAo38dfmkw3qcjw","name":"⏩Pull of Soul Tethers","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Dark Hunter","featureType":"weaving","requirement":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required","cost":"2HP","metadata":"Cost: 2HP\nPrerequisite: None\nTarget: Caster\nRange/Area: Caster\nDuration: 10 seconds (1 round)\nResistance: Optional","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"2","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/weaving:pull-of-soul-tethers","description":"Essence Weaving, Level 1 Dark Hunter Required\n\nSummary: Thrown weapons return to hand\n\nAttach Soul Tethers to weapons, allowing them to return to the Dark Hunter's hand after being thrown.\n\nFor the duration of the effect, all weapons the Dark Hunter uses for thrown attacks will automatically return to the Dark Hunter, regardless of whether they hit or miss. If the weapon was equipped, it would remain in its equipped state.\n\nWeapons or items that have special handling explicitly stated, such as \"lost\" or \"remains lodged in the target\" upon hitting with a thrown weapon, will prioritize those effects and will not return.","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Dark Hunter","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"pL2l3SZKXL3IPDoq","name":"⏩Poison Needle","type":"ability","system":{"source":"class","classId":"","className":"Alchemist","featureType":"evocation","requirement":"Evocation, 1st Level Alchemist Required","cost":"Black","metadata":"Cards: Black\nTarget: 1 character\nRange/Area: 2 (30m) / Shot\nDuration: 1 minute (6 rounds)\nResistance: Temporary","resourceData":{"baseRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"extraRhythm":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"rhythmCost":{"uplifting":0,"calming":0,"enchanting":0},"qiType":"","qiMin":0,"qiMax":0,"hpCost":"","cardCount":1,"suggestedCardColor":"","edgeAccumulation":0,"edgeCost":0},"defenseModifier":0,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/evocation:poison-needle","description":"The Alchemist releases a poisonous needle into the target. The target is poisoned and suffers Poison magic damage at the end of each Alchemist's turn who uses this Evocation for the duration of the effect.\n\nB: 1 damage\n\nA: 3 damage\n\nS: 5 damage\n\nSS: 10 damage","mpCost":0,"power":0,"powerTable":{},"critical":0,"criticalModifier":0,"hasPowerTable":false,"specialDamageBands":[],"school":"Alchemist","level":1},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
